# Licensed TradingView assets are NEVER committed. They are synced from the
# local licensed package by `npm run tv:sync`. See
# docs/architecture/tradingview-asset-strategy.md
# Contents rather than the directory itself: git cannot re-include a path whose
# parent directory is excluded, and the hand-written type shim below has to be
# committed. It contains nothing licensed — it exists so an untrusted pull
# request can typecheck without fetching the real package. See its header.
/vendor/tradingview/*
!/vendor/tradingview/types-shim/
/public/charting_library/
/public/datafeeds/

# TypeScript incremental build cache — a local artifact, not source.
*.tsbuildinfo
release.zip
